        "title": "Super Invader",
        "extract": "Super Invader (also called Super Invasion and Apple Invader) is a fixed shooter video game and a clone of Space Invaders. It was written by Japanese programmer M. Hata for the Apple II and published by Creative Computing Software in November 1979.\nIt was later published as  Cosmos Mission in September 1980 by the California Pacific Computer Company.",
