      {
        "pageid": 82338422,
        "ns": 0,
        "title": "Acecraft",
        "extract": "Acecraft (stylized as ACECRAFT) is a 2025 two-player cooperative vertical shoot 'em up video game developed by Vizta Games, a subsidiary of Moonton, and published internationally by Skystone Games. In Acecraft, players pilot aircraft through looping boss encounters, absorbing pink projectiles to fuel special attacks, combining random roguelike skills, and optionally partnering in two-player cooperative play.\nAcecraft was developed by Vizta Games, a subsidiary of Moonton, and produced by Darren \"Chen\" Lu. It entered a soft launch on Android in the United States in July 2024, followed by a closed beta test in Thailand from May 18 to June 17, 2025. The game was officially released worldwide on August 28, 2025, with Skystone Games handling publishing outside Asia.",
        "contentmodel": "wikitext",
        "pagelanguage": "en",
        "pagelanguagehtmlcode": "en",
